subject: Your Detag sign-in is temporarily locked

--- text ---
Hi,

Your Detag account was temporarily locked after several failed sign-in attempts. Sign-in is available again shortly — no action is needed unless the attempts were not yours.

If you did not try to sign in, change your password once you are back in. If the attempts continue, the lock re-applies automatically.

— The Detag team

--- html ---
<!doctype html>
<html>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f6f6f6;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f6f6f6;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;margin:24px 0;padding:32px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#222222;">
            <tr>
              <td>
                <p>Hi,</p>
                <p>Your Detag account was temporarily locked after several failed sign-in attempts. Sign-in is available again shortly — no action is needed unless the attempts were not yours.</p>
                <p>If you did not try to sign in, change your password once you are back in. If the attempts continue, the lock re-applies automatically.</p>
                <p>— The Detag team</p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
